      2026, and the body of the page had already been rewritten to say so. The
      stale notice stood above the corrected text from August 3 to August 9,
      2026, and has been removed.
    </p>

    <h3>006 · August 9, 2026 — superseded: the founding-board roster</h3>
    <p>
      The About page stated: "The founding board: David Sullivan, President ·
      Barbara K. Sullivan, Treasurer · Kenneth Magee, Secretary." True when
      written; on August 9, 2026 the board added Barry Shane and accepted
      Barbara K. Sullivan's withdrawal, and the offices were reassigned — David
      Sullivan, President and Treasurer; Kenneth Magee, Secretary; Barry Shane,
      Director. The page now carries the current board.
    </p>

    <h3>005 · August 9, 2026 — corrected: a certificate of adoption published with blanks</h3>
    <p>
      The certificate of adoption reproduced at the foot of the
      <a href="/bylaws/">Bylaws</a>, the <a href="/rights/">Constitution and
      Readers' Bill of Rights</a>, and the Conflict of Interest Policy on the
      <a href="/governance/">governance page</a> was published with a blank
